<Layout title="Building an AI Health App in Australia | Case Study"
  description="How PresciaIQ built LongevityAus — an AI-powered health and longevity app for the Australian market. A full technical and product case study.">
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
